Description: 4k intro by Faemiyah, released in 2008
 Stick Animation Engine 4000 is a 4k intro by Faemiyah (code by Trilkk,
 music and synth by Juippi), released at Assembly 2008, where it ranked
 2nd in the 4k intro competition. A blocky character dances on a
 checkered floor, to a soundtrack synthesised at startup.
 .
 This package contains the standard (non size-optimized) build of the
 intro, ported to SDL2. Press F to toggle fullscreen, Esc or Q to quit.
